.TH LALINFERENCE_DATADUMP "1" "January 2026" "LALInference" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lalinference_datadump \- a program from LALInference
.SH DESCRIPTION
.HP
\fB\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\fR
.HP
\fB\-\-\-\fR Data Parameters \fB\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\fR
.HP
\fB\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\fR
.IP
Options for reading/generating data. User should specify which interferometers
to use and their data source using the following options. The data source
can be either a LFS cache file (generated by gw_data_find) with channel name
(e.g. \fB\-\-H1\-cache\fR H1.cache \fB\-\-H1\-channel\fR H1:DCS\-CALIB\-STRAIN_C02 )
or internally\-generated gaussian noise with a given detector PSD model
(e.g. \fB\-\-H1\-cache\fR LALSimAdLIGO \fB\-\-dataseed\fR 1234)
or by searching for frame files in the local directory
(e.g. \fB\-\-glob\-frame\-data\fR \fB\-\-H1\-channel\fR H1:DCS\-CALIB\-STRAIN_C02)
.IP
Additional noise curves for simulated data can be specified by providing
their PSD or ASD as a text file. See detailed options below.
.HP
\fB\-\-ifo\fR IFO1 [\-\-ifo IFO2 ...] IFOs can be H1,L1,V1
.TP
\fB\-\-IFO1\-cache\fR cache1
Cache files
.TP
[\-\-IFO2\-cache2 cache2 ...]
lal PSDs: LAL{Ad}LIGO, LALVirgo
lalsimuation PSDs: LALSim{Ad}LIGO, LALSim{Ad}Virgo
interpolate from file: interp:asd_file.txt
.TP
\fB\-\-psdstart\fR GPStime
GPS start time of PSD estimation data
.TP
\fB\-\-psdlength\fR length
Length of PSD estimation data in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-seglen\fR length
Length of segments for PSD estimation and analysis in seconds
.TP
(\fB\-\-glob\-frame\-data\fR)
Will search for frame files containing data in the PWD.
Filenames must begin with the IFO's 1\-letter code, e.g. H\-*.gwf
.TP
(\fB\-\-dont\-dump\-extras\fR)
If given, won't save PSD and SNR files
.TP
(\fB\-\-dump\-geocenter\-pols\fR)
If given, print out the TD/FD h_plus and h_cross polarisations
.TP
(\fB\-\-trigtime\fR GPStime)
GPS time of the trigger to analyse
.IP
(optional when using \fB\-\-margtime\fR or \fB\-\-margtimephi\fR)
.TP
(\fB\-\-segment\-start\fR)
GPS time of the start of the segment
.TP
(optional with \fB\-\-trigtime\fR,
default: seglen\-2 s before \fB\-\-trigtime\fR)
.TP
(\fB\-\-srate\fR rate)
Downsample data to rate in Hz (4096.0,)
.TP
(\fB\-\-padding\fR PAD [sec]
Override default 0.4 seconds padding
.TP
(\fB\-\-injectionsrate\fR rate)
Downsample injection signal to rate in Hz (\fB\-\-srate\fR)
.TP
(\fB\-\-IFO1\-flow\fR freq1
Specify lower frequency cutoff for overlap integral (20.0)
.IP
[\-\-IFO2\-flow freq2 ...])
.TP
(\fB\-\-IFO1\-fhigh\fR freq1
Specify higher frequency cutoff for overlap integral (Nyquist
.TP
[\-\-IFO2\-fhigh freq2 ...])
freq 0.5*srate)
.TP
(\fB\-\-IFO1\-channel\fR chan1
Specify channel names when reading cache files
.IP
[\-\-IFO2\-channel chan2 ...])
.TP
(\fB\-\-IFO1\-asd\fR asd1\-ascii.txt
Read in ASD from ascii file. This is not equivalent
.TP
[\-\-IFO2\-asd asd2\-ascii.txt ...])
to using \fB\-\-IFO1\-cache\fR interp:asd_file.txt since the former
won't use the ascii ASD to generate fake noise.
.TP
(\fB\-\-IFO1\-psd\fR psd1\-ascii.txt
Read in PSD from ascii file. This is not equivalent
.TP
[\-\-IFO2\-psd psd2\-ascii.txt ...])
to using \fB\-\-IFO1\-cache\fR interp:asd_file.txt since the former
won't use the ascii PSD to generate fake noise.
.TP
(\fB\-\-dataseed\fR number)
Specify random seed to use when generating data
.TP
(\fB\-\-lalinspiralinjection\fR)
Enables injections via the LALInspiral package
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-fref\fR)
Reference frequency of parameters in injection XML (default 100Hz)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-lambda1\fR)
value of lambda1 to be injected, LALSimulation only (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-lambda2\fR)
value of lambda2 to be injected, LALSimulation only (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-lambdaT\fR
value of lambdaT to be injected (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-dlambdaT\fR
value of dlambdaT to be injected (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-logp1\fR)
value of logp1 to be injected
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-gamma1\fR)
value of gamma1 to be injected
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-gamma2\fR)
value of gamma2 to be injected
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-gamma3\fR)
value of gamma3 to be injected
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-SDgamma0\fR)
value of SDgamma0 to be injected (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-SDgamma1\fR)
value of SDgamma1 to be injected (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-SDgamma2\fR)
value of SDgamma2 to be injected (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-SDgamma3\fR)
value of SDgamma3 to be injected (0)
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-spinOrder\fR PNorder)
Specify twice the injection PN order (e.g. 5 <==> 2.5PN)
.TP
of spin effects effects to use, only for LALSimulation
(default: \fB\-1\fR <==> Use all spin effects).
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-tidalOrder\fR PNorder)
Specify twice the injection PN order (e.g. 10 <==> 5PN)
.TP
of tidal effects to use, only for LALSimulation
(default: \fB\-1\fR <==> Use all tidal effects).
.TP
(\fB\-\-inj\-spin\-frame\fR FRAME
Specify injection spin frame: choice of total\-j, orbital\-l, view.
.IP
(Default = OrbitalL).
.IP
(\fB\-\-inj\-numreldata\fR FileName) Location of NR data file for the injection of NR waveforms (with NR_hdf5 in injection XML file).
(\fB\-\-0noise\fR)                  Sets the noise realisation to be identically zero
.IP
(for the fake caches above only)
